    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:\r\rLocation Plan \rPlanning Statement,\r575726 050 - Exisitng Plans\r575726 051 - Existing and proposed elevations and sections\r575726 052 - Proposed plans\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning. \r",
